Directly editing a template
When you directly modify resources in the stack's template to generate a change set, 
CloudFormation classiﬁes the change as a direct modiﬁcation, as opposed to changes initiated by 
an updated parameter value. The following change set, which added a new tag to the i-1abc23d4
instance, is an example of a direct modiﬁcation. All other input values, such as the parameter 
values and capabilities, are unchanged, so we'll focus on the Changes structure.
